WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.570
Your small business answers the same questions every day.

2
00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:08.797
What if you explained it well once, and a video kept doing the job for you?

3
00:00:09.297 --> 00:00:12.730
Every small business fields the same questions daily.

4
00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:18.548
A short video answers each one the same way, without anyone on your team stopping what they're doing.

5
00:00:19.048 --> 00:00:21.900
Video shows the steps while it explains them.

6
00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:28.763
It works when you're offline, keeps every detail accurate and on brand, and captions help more people understand.

7
00:00:29.448 --> 00:00:33.961
